{
  "name": "Beacon: scan requested from monday.com",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Beacon: a monday.com item asks for a scan\n\nA monday.com automation (**When status changes to ..., send a webhook**) or any other caller POSTs `{ \"itemId\": \"1234567890\", \"url\": \"https://www.example-estates.co.uk\" }` here. Beacon runs a one-off scan and the **Beacon: callback** workflow posts the result back to the item.\n\n1. Create a **Header Auth** credential `Beacon API key` (name `Authorization`, value `Bearer bcn_...`).\n2. Set `beaconUrl` and `callbackUrl` in **Config**.\n3. The `Idempotency-Key` is built from the item id, so a webhook that monday.com sends twice starts one scan. If the site already has a scan running, Beacon answers `409` and this workflow fails visibly.\n4. Use the **production** webhook URL in monday.com, and keep it secret: anyone with it can start scans of your allowed domains.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "b3a3c3d3-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Read me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, -240]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "beacon-request-scan",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b3a3c3d3-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [320, 120],
      "webhookId": "beacon-request-scan"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "name": "beaconUrl",
              "value": "https://beacon.example.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "name": "callbackUrl",
              "value": "https://n8n.example.com/webhook/beacon-callback",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3",
              "name": "itemId",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body.itemId) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c4",
              "name": "url",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.url }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b3a3c3d3-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [540, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.beaconUrl }}/api/v1/scans",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{ 'monday-' + $json.itemId }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ url: $json.url, source: 'monday', callbackUrl: $json.callbackUrl, metadata: { mondayItemId: $json.itemId } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b3a3c3d3-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Start scan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [760, 120],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "Beacon API key"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Config", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Config": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Start scan", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "active": false
}
